          <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Compare two imperial armies, 3,000 years apart.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/attractions/huaqing-pool" class="group rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-4 hover:border-terracotta-200 transition-colors no-underline">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-terracotta-700 transition-colors">Huaqing Hot Springs</p>
